[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-university-college-birmingham-scholarship-2026-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity-221":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},221,"university-college-birmingham-scholarship-2026-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity-221","University College Birmingham Scholarship 2026 In Uk: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>The University College Birmingham Vice Chancellor Scholarship covers the full tuition fee for selected international students who seek to study at the institution in the United Kingdom (UK).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University College Birmingham Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: University College Birmingham (UCB)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-uk\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-UK\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: United Kingdom\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: October 31, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University College Birmingham Vice Chancellor Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University College Birmingham (UCB) Vice Chancellor Scholarship is a full scholarship support for outstanding international students who demonstrate academic excellence.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The prestigious University College Birmigham Vice Chancellor Scholarships aim to recognise and support outstanding international students who demonstrate academic excellence, leadership qualities, and a commitment to the betterment of society.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>University College Birmingham is a centre of excellence for higher \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Funiversity-college-birmingham-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>education\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> and as one of our students, you will have so many opportunities to gain real-life experience and immerse yourself in your industry.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University College Birmingham Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University College Birmingham Scholarship covers the full tuition fee for the first year of your study.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>University College Birmingham Vice Chancellor Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate and postgraduate University College Birmingham Vice Chancellor Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You must have received and accepted an offer to study on a full-time undergraduate or postgraduate programme at University College Birmingham starting in September 2025. Part-time courses, distance learning courses or other levels of study are not eligible.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You must have overseas fee status and be paying overseas tuition fees. Home fee payers are not eligible.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The minimum requirements are 144 UCAS tariff points (or international equivalents) for undergraduate programmes and 1st class honours (or international equivalents) for postgraduate programmes.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>This scholarship is available to students’ first year of study only.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You agree to provide testimonials, feature in case studies, and\u002For participate in marketing activities upon\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for University College Birmingham Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the University College Birmingham Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click the button below to visit the university’s webpage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for admission and obtain an offer.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit your application via \u003Ca class=\"wpel-icon-right\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Feur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\u002F?url=https%3A%2F%2Fairtable.com%2FappXdfVILEpFCfRhZ%2FshrQa8lyOipRlXYrG&amp;data=05%7C02%7CKClossick%40ucb.ac.uk%7C2fa16dcf926d433458c108dd07bcd0ed%7Ca39505537d10400bbc8d89c957233230%7C0%7C0%7C638675229741919876%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=7%2FM1Cjsm1pPePb19WhaIduQlS55muoaVkX%2FOfuWab40%3D&amp;reserved=0\">this link\u003C\u002Fa> for the Vice Chancellor’s Award by \u003Cstrong>31 October 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Include a personal statement and in 500 words, demonstrate your achievements in your field of study, your career aspirations, and your contribution to the betterment of society.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will be notified of the outcome via email.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ucb.ac.uk\u002Funiversity\u002Fstudent-support\u002Ffinancial-support\u002Fscholarships-and-waivers\u002Fvice-chancellor-s-award\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.ucb.ac.uk\u002Funiversity\u002Fstudent-support\u002Ffinancial-support\u002Fscholarships-and-waivers\u002Fvice-chancellor-s-award\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-08 18:28:02",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-college-birmingham-scholarship-2026-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69fe1d2256f869.26913655_screenshot 2026-05-08 182145.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-college-birmingham-scholarship-2026-in-uk-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69fe1d2256f869.26913655_screenshot%202026-05-08%20182145.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings